scroll-my-marbles (1.2.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix udev rule ordering (renamed to 70-scroll-my-marbles.rules) so systemd uaccess grants active user ACLs before 73-seat-late.rules.
  * Add permission error diagnostics and physical device detection in /proc/bus/input/devices.
  * Make the 'Rescan Devices' button provide immediate AdwToast feedback and update status banner on permission denial.
  * Trigger immediate worker thread reconnect upon clicking Rescan Devices.

