scroll-my-marbles (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add out-of-the-box support for Logitech TrackMan Marble T-BC21 (046d:c408).
  * Set default scroll modifier to BTN_SIDE (small left button) and click to BTN_MIDDLE.
  * Add chord modifier mode (both side buttons simultaneously).
  * Adjust default vertical and horizontal sensitivities to 50 and 200.
  * Update udev hardware rules and virtual uinput device attributes.

 -- RidgeBridgeStudios <contact@example.com>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 21:55:00 +0200

scroll-my-marbles (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Scroll My Marbles for Linux.
  * Added evdev exclusive grab and virtual uinput event forwarding.
  * Added vertical/horizontal scroll emulation with sensitivity control.
  * Added reverse/natural scrolling and smooth high-res scrolling.
  * Added middle-click emulation upon releasing scroll modifier without motion.
  * Added auxiliary button remapping (BTN_SIDE, BTN_EXTRA, etc.).
  * Added modern GTK4 + Libadwaita settings preferences window.
  * Added native StatusNotifierItem / DBus system tray indicator.
  * Added udev rules for unprivileged access.

 -- RidgeBridgeStudios <contact@example.com>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0200
